{"run_id": "run_da4a02a0cf91", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_007", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s07_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？我正在上课，麻烦简短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，长话短说。课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原有流程不变。低延迟适合互动课，延迟1-2秒；标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本低些。您之前用的是低延迟链路。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道了。那我现在怎么设置？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "您是通过Web控制台还是第三方系统发布课程？我指导您查看。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "Web控制台，但我现在没空看。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "理解。后续我们会通过企业微信发通知，您有空时查看即可。如果配置费用或学员课包抵扣，低延迟也支持。您还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，不打扰您上课了，祝您工作顺利！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_da4a02a0cf91", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_008", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s08_qa_interrupt", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "我们课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "知道，那我现在要做什么？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "您需要根据课程场景选择直播类型。标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本较低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟1-2秒，互动更好，适合小班课或实操课。费用上低延迟会高一些。您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "Web控制台，但我没看到低延迟直播选项。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "可能是后台配置未完成，请稍后刷新页面或联系平台确认。如果还是看不到，可以进入“我的”页面，在直播平台设置中勾选低延迟直播。另外，如果学员课包抵扣或直播链路费用已配置，低延迟直播也可使用该费用，您需要我指导设置路径吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "不用，我自己看看。还有别的事吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需通过验证或同步提示。如果没有其他问题，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "好的，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "explained", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_da4a02a0cf91", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_009", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s09_rejection", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "我是课程发布平台的客户支持专员。我们近期在课程发布页面新增了“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，想跟您介绍一下。原有的发布流程不变，只是多了一个选择。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "我们现在的流程挺好的，不想改什么设置。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解您觉得现有流程够用。不过想确认一下，您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，对吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "应该是吧，反正一直能用，没必要动。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我简单说明一下区别：标准直播延迟约5-10秒，成本较低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动更好，适合小班课或实操课。费用上低延迟会高一些。如果您的课程需要实时互动，建议选低延迟。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我们目前没有互动需求，标准直播就够了，不想增加成本。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "明白。那您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程的呢？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "Web控制台。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，如果您以后想切换，可以在Web控制台的课程发布页面选择低延迟直播。另外，如果您的学员使用课包抵扣或直播链路费用，低延迟直播也可以配置同样的费用。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "我们目前没有用课包抵扣，费用都是固定的。真的不需要改。"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "完全理解。我会记录您暂时不需要调整配置。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需要验证或同步提示。请问还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，感谢您的接听，祝您工作顺利！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_da4a02a0cf91", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_010", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s10_faq_cost", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我们课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。想跟您说明一下。您之前知道实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "不太清楚，我们一直用默认的。那这两个有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那低延迟直播是不是更贵？我们比较在意成本。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，低延迟直播成本通常高于标准直播，但具体费用取决于您的套餐。您可以通过Web控制台、校验系统A或SaaS系统B发布课程，我指导您查看配置？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我们用SaaS系统B。那怎么配置低延迟直播？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "在SaaS系统B中，进入“我的”页面，找到直播平台设置，选择直播平台后，在产品配置中勾选低延迟直播即可。如果暂时看不到，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系我们确认。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "那学员课包抵扣或直播链路费用，低延迟直播也能用吗？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "如果已经配置了相关费用，低延迟直播也可使用。如无法确认，可进入费用配置页编辑低延迟直播对应费用后保存。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我明白了。还有其他要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需通过验证或同步提示。请问还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利！再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task